REFUSED zensight-console: a `cn` on a face: a face principal is an operator the face's usrpwd authenticated, bound by `user` alone — a certificate or zid principal belongs to the principal plan (`acl gen` without --face), which runs under a deny default this face's router cannot share (RFC 09 §4 (v1.49)) — left out of subjects and policies
